# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated reports and evidence dumps.
#
# These contain real account data: account IDs, resource names and ARNs, IAM
# usernames, security findings, and (for --json-out) complete raw AWS API
# responses. Never commit them.
#
# The default output directory is covered, plus every report basename the
# skills emit -- in case someone points --output-dir somewhere else inside
# the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
reports/output/
out/

architecture-discovery.*
cost-optimization.*
security-review.*
network-traffic-analysis.*
well-architected-evidence.*
organizations-posture.*
dr-readiness.*

*-evidence.json
*-inventory.json

*.pdf
!tests/fixtures/**/*.pdf

# The report basenames above are deliberately unanchored, so a stray
# --output-dir anywhere in the repo is still ignored. That also matched
# skills/aws-well-architected-review/references/pillars/cost-optimization.md,
# a tracked source doc -- skill reference content is never generated output,
# so re-include it.
!skills/**/references/**/*.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environments, editors, and tool caches beyond the ones above.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
venv/
env/
.env
.env.*
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
build/
dist/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.log

# Packaged copies of this repo (see the sibling .zip in the workspace).
*.zip
